<!--Post: 2128--><!--Time: 1103326918-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2128"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Puzzler<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Puzzler<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 17, 2004 - 3:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think the pictures BTK took of the victims are the most important momento for him.  The Nancy Fox DL would be important, but not as important as the pictures. <BR> <BR>Maybe BTK is dying, or is sick and thinks he is dying, and wants to &#34;give up&#34; some of the incriminating evidence that would be found after his death.  I would like to know where he has been for 30 years.  That is a very long cooling off period for a serial killer.  I personally think he has been commiting murders all along.  Maybe in other states? <BR> <BR>I think the people of Wichita will be very surprised when and if BTK is ever caught.  I think he will be someone who is well know in the city by a name other than BTK.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2128-->
<!--Post: 5543--><!--Time: 1107184162-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5543"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Getting back to BTK&#39;s age and physical condition, I wonder if he has paddle shaped fingers? That would be easy to spot. Wichitans, keep your eyes open.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5543-->
<!--Post: 5559--><!--Time: 1107192361-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5559"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 9:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;I wonder if he has paddle shaped fingers?&#34; <BR> <BR>Please explain...I don&#39;t understand...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5559-->
<!--Post: 5622--><!--Time: 1107220218-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5622"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 5:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->An oddity often seen in the very nimblefingered. Dr. John Hill&#40;Blood and Money&#41; had them if I remember correctly. My aunt&#39;s doctor boyfriend had them. One of the first killers on Unsolved Mysteries had them. Probably a remote chance, but interesting nonetheless.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5622-->
<!--Post: 5627--><!--Time: 1107221662-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5627"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 5:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Spatulate fingertips is the term used in palmistry and medicine. As I was searching for a term that was better that &#39;paddle-shaped&#39;, I remembered that I have a book on palmistry and criminal behavior, based on actual criminal cases. I shall search for it. I pray that I have not thrown it away in a moment of trying to be organized. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5627-->
<!--Post: 5649--><!--Time: 1107236872-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5649"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 9:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe the BTK Strangler is approximately 54 years of age. He suggested in correspondences during the 1970s he may be an adolescent by using terms, such as dude. He recently stated he was born in 1939. Both portraits are attempts to manipulate and taunt the police and public. I suppose he attended college in the early to mid 1970s. The unknown subject asked Kevin Bright, if he attended university. He asked the question, because he had the intention of murdering Kevin Bright. He could not foresee Bright surviving the attack.   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5649-->
<!--Post: 5666--><!--Time: 1107274950-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5666"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 8:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ivy: I do think that you are correct. He is mid 50&#39;s. His use of &#34;CITY&#34; on one of his letter envelopes implies his age. It has been a long time ago that usage of that for mailing within the city was used. I have not used that in more years than I like to remember.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5666-->
<!--Post: 5822--><!--Time: 1107391800-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5822"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 4:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree that sexual sadist do not change.  I have always thought that serial rapist raped not because they had a sex issue but because they had a control issue.  That is why do not believe that castration is not the key punishment for rape.  If you castrate a serial rapist you may end up turning them into a serial killer... because you have taken away their weapon... they will find some other way to achieve mental and physical fulfillment... maybe by using an object or by committing murder.  The reason I bring this up his because of this -- do you really believe BTK has not committed a crime since the mid-1980s?  Remember, sexual sadist don&#39;t change.  If he has not been killing anyone since the mid-1980s because of his age or aging he has probably been molesting children.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5822-->
<!--Post: 5843--><!--Time: 1107400494-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5843"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 7:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good point Lmuncy316 perhaps he is not a true sexual sadistic serial killer...Perhaps he studied what real sadistic serial killers would do and did what he in fact did as an interpretation of it for a more deeper purpose.  He does make many references to other serial killers and he has obviously studied well.  But he does not appear to truly posses the same psychological make up as they do. He is a smart feller.  What do you think he truly seeks beyond his crimes? <BR> <BR>Doom<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5843-->
<!--Post: 5853--><!--Time: 1107404576-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5853"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 8:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sexually Sadistic Killers and child molesters/pedophiles are two completely different monsters.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5853-->
<!--Post: 5884--><!--Time: 1107443257-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5884"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 7:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Doom -- thank you for your opinion.  I do not necessarily think there is another motive or something he seeks beyond the crimes!  I have done a lot of true crime studying, and I have learned some people just enjoy killing!  However, Leopold and Loeb were two men with extremely high IQs.  They committed murder to see what it would be like or to see if they could get away with it because of their superior intellect.  The Leopold and Loeb case was really our nations&#39; first thrill killing &#40;that we know about&#41;.  Now, it&#39;s possible that BTK chooses to kill to see if he can get away with it!  Remember, he too is extremely intelligent.  It&#39;s true that he might be seeking fame, glory, and a place in history.  However, I believe BTK wishes he wasn&#39;t the way he is.  Yet, he gives in to his monster.  The murders give him mental and sexual satisfaction.  But, I do not believe he kills because it&#39;s the only way you can achieve an organism.  I believe he enjoys killing so much that he achieves an orgasm regardless <BR> <BR>Lilymarie -- I know that sexual sadistic killers and child molesters/pedophiles are two completely different monsters.  My point was this: if a serial killer is no longer able to kill because of his aging, isn&#39;t it likely that he would find another way to relieve his mental frustration by committing a different type of crime &#40;not by choice but by necessity&#41;.  Please tell me what you think.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5884-->
<!--Post: 5890--><!--Time: 1107445993-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5890"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 7:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LM - I agree that if he is no longer able to kill that he is frustrated and probably isn&#39;t coping very well...therefore, he is getting some relief by sending the letters and packages. A poor substitute but terrifying and controlling none-the-less.  <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t believe that he can substitute a different kind of crime to fill the need to be sadistic. Sick as it is, pedophilia isn&#39;t considered a sadistic crime - it is a sexual preference. It is a crime because it hurts children.  <BR> <BR>It&#39;s the same thing as those who say that homosexual couples can&#39;t adopt children because they will be molested. Homosexuals aren&#39;t pedophiles any more than heterosexuals are &#40;% of population&#41;. <BR> <BR>Now, I would be more inclined to believe that this killer was torturing &amp; killing animals or writing sadistic comics &amp; stories, or visiting very sick web sites as a substitute.  <BR> <BR>I agree that for some reason, he doesn&#39;t have the physical capacity to commit his previous crimes and hasn&#39;t been able to since sometime shortly after the last one in the 80&#39;s. I think that in the gap between the 70&#39;s and 80&#39;s he was repeating his crimes somewhere else and came back &#40;moved back?&#41; to Wichita to commit the last one.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5890-->
<!--Post: 5897--><!--Time: 1107448604-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5897"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lilymarie -- I agree with some of the things you say.  I am not sure that he moved out of the Wichita area and the crimes resumed when he moved back.  However, this is one of the most likeliest assumptions.  I have many assumptions concerning BTK, his first victims &#40;maybe not the Otero&#39;s&#41;, poetry, numerology and alphabetical codes.  I have so much to say but it&#39;s hard to jump back and forth from page to page.  I was thinking about starting a new thread &#40;maybe under miscellaneous or theory message boards&#41; where people would be able to say just about anything concerning BTK.  What do you think?  I would also like to be able to chat or instant message you, but I am new to this forum and I don&#39;t know much about chatting even though I know a lot about computers.  Figure out a way that we can speak person-to-person of sorts.  OK?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5897-->
<!--Post: 5898--><!--Time: 1107448708-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5898"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cyndi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cyndi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Sick as it is, pedophilia isn&#39;t considered a sadistic crime - it is a sexual preference. It is a crime because it hurts children. &#34; <BR> <BR>Lilymarie I&#39;m confused.  Is pedophilia a crime or is it a sexual preference?  I tend to think it&#39;s a CRIME. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5898-->
<!--Post: 5900--><!--Time: 1107449781-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5900"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 8:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Of course its a crime. It&#39;s not considered a &#34;sadistic&#34; crime as my post above states. Read the 2nd sentence and you won&#39;t be confused because I state &#34;It is a crime&#34; because it hurts children - of which I have 4. Many sexual perversions are not crimes because they don&#39;t hurt anyone. Pedophiles are criminals - there isn&#39;t punishment in this world enough for what they do. <BR> <BR>Please don&#39;t twist my obvious message into something it isn&#39;t.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5900-->
<!--Post: 5917--><!--Time: 1107456730-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5917"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 10:52 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK may be paralyzed or debilitated from an illness to the point he cannot kill againbut enjoys reliving his old glories and tormenting the people of Wichita...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5917-->
<!--Post: 5945--><!--Time: 1107461291-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5945"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lmuncy316 - yes, I&#39;d be happy to IM with you. Do you enter the discussion at all? I do a couple of times a week. I&#39;m easy to spot by name...there are a lot of smart and interested people but it can take up a lot of time &#40;which I don&#39;t have&#41;. <BR> <BR>One thing that has been helpful to me before starting a thread - is to go to the search function and use some keywords about the subject you are interested in starting. If you are interested in numerology and codes, there are a lot of really educated and interesting posts. I wouldn&#39;t begin to pretend to have any skill in those areas.  <BR> <BR>You&#39;ll like this board for the most part. People definitely have their opinions...and I suppose I&#39;m one of those too! <BR> <BR>If you can&#39;t find a thread for your theory - try the new one under Theories - Off The Wall - it seems you can post just about anything there!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5945-->
<!--Post: 5962--><!--Time: 1107467478-->
